    "WHERE EACH CHANNEL IS ON THIS BOX. What each one MEANS is schema/channels.v1.json.",
    "",
    "To support a second box generation: copy this file, change the numbers, and point",
    "hardware/_default.json at it. Every task profile is untouched -- provided the",
    "channel NAMES are the same, which is exactly what resolving by name buys.",
    "",
    "`watch_bit` is a dense 0-based index over the WATCHABLE channels only (engagement",
    "and response). It is declared rather than derived so that reordering this file",
    "cannot silently change what a position means; RIG101 checks the density."
  ],
